# Neon Pairs repairs

User requested four fixes, a plan first, a separate subagent for each task, and no code edits by the primary agent. Plan was communicated before delegation. Primary reviews and runs integration checks; implementation belongs to task agents.

Requirements: docs/README.md and its linked documents, spec 2.2. Preserve all other behavior and package pins. Follow .agents/loader.md, load context for working files, and reread KeepInMind before handoff.

Tasks, run separately because only one child slot is available:

1. Best scores: implemented by best_scores. src/game/session/storage.ts now preserves equal/worse records and updates only a first or lower result. src/game/status/GameStatus.tsx shows none for missing records. Existing storage tests reproduced two failures before the fix; afterward storage.test.ts and session.test.ts passed all 17 tests, including completed-import exclusion and unfinished-import completion. Prettier passed both changed files. Existing browser score/status tests cover persistence, per-size records and missing records; final browser verification remains with primary.
2. Keyboard: implemented by keyboard_navigation in src/game/board/use-board-focus.ts and Board.tsx. A board-local keydown handler moves remembered focus with the four unmodified arrows, stops at each edge, prevents arrow page scrolling and uses existing nearest alignment. Native Enter/Space/Tab and other keys are untouched; matched, mismatching and paused cards retain navigation. Reuses existing navigation browser journeys; no extra modifier/unsupported-key tests because docs/README.md explicitly places those cases outside tested scope. npm run typecheck and targeted Prettier check passed. Primary owns fresh-build browser validation.
3. Motion: V17-V18, C12. card.css and status.css have effects but no reduced-motion overrides. Preserve normal effects and static imported completion.
4. Silence: S01-S02, I16. use-game.ts adds AudioContext chimes on matches/wins. Remove all audio behavior; preserve announcements.

Initial git status was clean. Use git -c safe.directory=/work for repository reads. Node v26.12.1 is present. Locked npm install completed successfully per primary; browser setup and full validation remain. Required final checks: typecheck, unit/static tests, fresh build and browser suite, format check. Tasks 1 and 2 source changes are complete so far.

